{"story_id":16927,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T16:51:31","headline_en":"Security forces kill 21-year-old Burhan Wani in Anantnag district","headline_hi":"सुरक्षा बलों ने अनंतनाग जिले में 21 वर्षीय बुरहान वानी को मार गिराया","payload_en":{"story_id":16927,"headline":"Security forces kill 21-year-old Burhan Wani in Anantnag district","counts":{"articles":8,"independent_sources":8,"outlets":8},"has_established":true,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["ABP News","Amar Ujala","India Today","Jagran","Live Hindustan","NDTV India","News18","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":16927,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-09T16:51:31","category":{"primary":["justice","politics"],"secondary":["terror","parties"]},"places":["jammu-kashmir"],"people":["Burhan Wani","Peoples Democratic Party","Abdul Kabir Khan","Kishtwar","Hizbul Mujahideen","Kokernag","Amit Raina","Bashir Ahmed"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Burhan Wani was killed by security forces in Kokernag in Anantnag district at age 21.","ids":[44163],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Burhan Wani was a poster boy of militancy in the Valley.","ids":[44144],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"The Peoples Democratic Party and BJP formed a coalition government in Jammu and Kashmir in 2014.","ids":[44148],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"Burhan Wani was a posterboy of the Hizbul Mujahideen terrorist group.","ids":[44165],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Burhan Wani was killed in an encounter with security forces in Kokernag, Anantnag district on 8 July 2016. Wani was a commander of Hizbul Mujahideen.","ids":[44143,44150,44136,44159],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]},{"text":"PDP leader Abdul Kabir addressed a meeting of party workers in Kishtwar district on Thursday and spoke to journalists at a party event in Jammu also on Thursday. Kabir called Wani a martyr last Thursday.","ids":[44167,44145,44152],"class":"single","sources":[3,4,6]},{"text":"Kabir was arrested by police in Kishtwar on Friday 09 October 2026.","ids":[44141],"class":"single","sources":[2,5]}],[{"text":"PDP leader Kabir called Burhan Wani a martyr at an event on October 09, 2026, and he called the deceased Hizbul Mujahideen commander a martyr on Thursday.","ids":[44142,44169],"parts":[{"text":"PDP leader Kabir called Burhan Wani a martyr at an event on October 09, 2026,","ids":[44142],"class":"established"},{"text":"and he called the deceased Hizbul Mujahideen commander a martyr on Thursday.","ids":[44169],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,5,6,7,8]},{"text":"He claimed that BJP leaders visited Burhan Wani's house and provided compensation after he was killed, adding that BJP leaders visited the house with compensation after his death.","ids":[44194,44195,44138],"parts":[{"text":"He claimed that BJP leaders visited Burhan Wani's house","ids":[44194],"class":"single"},{"text":"and provided compensation after he was killed,","ids":[44195],"class":"single"},{"text":"adding that BJP leaders visited the house with compensation after his death.","ids":[44138],"class":"unverified"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,3,5,6,7]},{"text":"His comment was his personal opinion and was freedom of speech in a democratic country, he said.","ids":[44190,44192],"class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"text":"BJP leaders accused Kabir Khan of glorifying terrorists and inciting people.","ids":[44155],"class":"single","sources":[4]},{"text":"Roots in Kashmir spokesperson Amit Raina criticized the PDP leader for praising a terrorist.","ids":[44139],"class":"unverified","sources":[5,7]},{"text":"BJP leader Yudhvir Sethi accused the PDP of promoting terrorism and demanded an apology, demanded an apology from PDP leaders to the families of soldiers who died fighting terrorism, and criticized the statement.","ids":[44140,44156,44183],"class":"single","sources":[4,5,7]}],[{"text":"National Conference leader Bashir Ahmed criticized Kabir Khan's statement as PDP's double character.","ids":[44157],"class":"single","sources":[4]},{"text":"The remark has triggered outrage and has renewed debate over the Peoples Democratic Party’s position on militancy and terrorism.","ids":[44186,44188],"class":"single","sources":[8]}],[{"text":"Police registered a case against Peoples Democratic Party leader Kabir Khan on Friday.","ids":[44153],"class":"single","sources":[4]},{"text":"Police summoned Peoples Democratic Party leader Kabir Khan for questioning on Friday.","ids":[44154],"class":"single","sources":[4]},{"text":"Kishtwar police summoned Peoples Democratic Party leader Kabir to the police station for questioning on Friday.","ids":[44171],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"Peoples Democratic Party leader Kabir was detained in Kishtwar for questioning.","ids":[44161],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"There is widespread criticism and political controversy in the region following the statement.","ids":[44174],"class":"single","sources":[6]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","explained","happened","say","say","say","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jk-pdp-leader-detained-after-calling-terrorist-burhan-wani-a-martyr/articleshow/134815420.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"J&K: PDP leader detained after calling terrorist Burhan Wani a 'martyr'","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/burhan-wani-remark-pdp-leader-abdul-kabir-arrested-in-kishtwar-ptag-3013149-2026-10-09","outlet":"India Today","title":"Mehaboba Mufti's party leader calls terrorist Burhan Wani a martyr, arrested","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.amarujala.com/jammu/pdp-leader-terms-burhan-wani-martyr-questions-bjp-leaders-compensation-to-militant-s-family-2026-10-09","outlet":"Amar Ujala","title":"जम्मू-कश्मीर: पीडीपी नेता ने बुरहान वानी को बताया 'शहीद', भाजपा नेताओं के मुआवजे